WEBVTT

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.920
Blue Angel lost.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.720
Welcome home.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.770
Move!

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:20.340
Into the VRAINS!

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:45.080
I pulverized your blue love.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:48.310
But it wasn’t much of a love to begin with.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.260
You can no longer leave.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.980
You'll vanish with us.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:01:01.000
How fitting for LINK 
VRAINS’s pathetic idol.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:09.180
Boss!  Spectre vanished!

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.060
Find him!  Go after him!

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:14.540
But what about Blue Angel?

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:16.340
Listen closely!

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:20.660
We’re the only ones who can report 
what’s going on in LINK VRAINS!

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:24.280
If we don’t, we stayed here for nothing-

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.430
- Aoi!
- Yes?

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:29.010
- Aoi!
- Yes?

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.010
Someone’s coming!

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.240
Then we can search for Playmaker!

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:35.490
Let’s go!

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:39.820
Aoi!

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:41.730
Aoi!

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:43.680
What?

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.400
What’s this?

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.260
You shouldn’t touch that.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.480
You’re…

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:01.540
There’s a strong computer 
virus in those vines.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:05.180
If you touch it, you'll lose consciousness.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.850
Dr. Kogami!

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.520
Aren't you dead?

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:12.570
I did die.  Due to SOL Technologies.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.240
SOL Technologies?

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.960
But I resurrected.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.710
I run Across the universe

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.880
At the speed of light

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.750
Begin Loading

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:43.490
Open the door of dreams

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:47.060
VRAINS spreads

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:50.160
Believe in myself

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.700
VRAINS continues

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:59.010
The circuit draws the future

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:03.080
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:04.680
Access!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.380
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:08.980
I'm now With the Wind

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:11.280
Link with my soul

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:14.050
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.790
Now Win the Race

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:18.630
Connected world

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:22.130
No matter when

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.500
Nothing is impossible

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:29.640
Strive for hope

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:34.220
And ride the wind!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.410
It’s changing LINK VRAINS 
into data and absorbing it.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.700
If we don’t hurry, we’ll be done for!

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.120
What's this?

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:29.420
If the bridge vanishes, 
we can't get to the tower!

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.700
Let’s go!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.440
What an incredible view.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:40.240
If there only was a Data Storm...  That's it!

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.570
I should create one!

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.600
Don’t do it.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:48.170
If the tower absorbs a Data Storm, 
it'll be completed quicker.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:52.140
I see.  So we just have to hurry.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.600
Revolver is there.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:05.980
You’re…

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:09.760
He's the guy who fought Kitamura.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.420
My name is Spectre.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.450
We finally meet, Playmaker.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.940
Move out of the way!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.970
I can’t let you pass.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:26.850
Revolver ordered me to destroy anyone 
who interfered with our plans.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:32.770
You'll meet the same fate as Blue Angel.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.020
What?

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.540
You defeated Blue Angel?

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:40.650
Yes.  Without having to use my full strength.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.080
Yusaku stopped moving.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.510
Has he met the enemy?

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.420
But without visuals...

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:53.910
This is from the net TV guys...

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.250
They stayed behind?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:59.110
If I send them Yusaku’s coordinates…

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.340
He’s not here, Boss!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.050
Where did he go?

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:06.620
He's here somewhere!  Find him!

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:10.050
Boss!  Someone sent us mail!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.100
Mail?

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:16.300
They're LINK VRAINS coordinates!

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.640
Something must be there!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.800
Thank you, anonymous viewer!

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:21.710
Let’s go!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.130
Roger!

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:31.720
SOL Technologies killed 
you?  What do you mean?

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:36.420
Ten years ago, I worked for SOL Technologies.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:40.900
You're saying that the company 
ordered the Lost Incident?

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:45.350
No.  That company can’t 
comprehend my ideas.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:51.370
When the incident came to light, the company 
imprisoned me and covered everything up.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:56.430
In order to monopolize the Ignis I developed.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:00.650
They smelled money when it came to Ignis.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:06.410
If the incident was publicized, they 
thought the police would seize the Ignis.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.380
No way…

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:13.630
They infected me with a computer 
virus to put me in a coma.

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:18.010
I was able to go home 
years after the incident.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.110
They thought I was dead.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.620
But my son didn’t give up.

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:31.840
He removed the virus, and he 
recreated my mind in the network.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:36.410
You formed the Knights of Hanoi to 
get revenge on SOL Technologies?

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.180
Revenge is incorrect.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:43.020
Our only goal is to kill the Ignis.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:44.590
Why?

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:48.250
They were supposed to guide the world.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:52.300
But they’re savages 
that'll destroy the world.

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.270
Savages?

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:59.520
No one knows what it truly means 
for an AI to have free will.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:03.260
They’re far beyond what I imagined.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.000
They must be dealt with.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:11.470
Wait!  What'll happen to my sister?

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:16.350
Those imprisoned in the 
tower can no longer escape.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:22.410
When the Tower of Hanoi is completed, 
data worldwide will be destroyed.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:25.930
Even us since we’re part of the data.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:31.800
You've involved everything for 
the Ignis, including yourselves.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:35.400
It's the only way left.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:38.460
The Tower of Hanoi will be completed soon.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:44.940
If you want to see the world end, stay there.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.390
Dr. Kogami!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:51.880
Aoi!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.780
Aoi!

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:59.250
You defeated Blue Angel?

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:02.860
She was talking about blue love or something.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:05.600
Blue Ai?  What do you mean?
 Note: "Ai" and "love" are pronounced the same in Japanese.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.980
Who knows.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:11.620
I have no clue what that 
vain girl was talking about.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.560
Perfect timing.  Please look at that.

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:16.300
That’s…

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.820
Blue Angel!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.360
Now do you believe me?

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:37.310
She had no skill, so she 
wasn't ready to save me.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:38.980
You…

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:42.840
I’ll send you to the same place as her.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.050
Here I go!

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.900
I’m looking forward to it.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:49.060
Duel!

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.200
I shall go first!

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:55.920
I summon Sunseed Genius Loci!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:02.020
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:07.680
The summoning condition is one 
Plant-Type Normal Monster.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:10.930
I set Sunseed Genius Loci!

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.360
Link Summon!

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:16.670
Appear, Link 1 Sunavalon Dryas!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.140
0 ATK…

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.610
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:31.550
Blue Angel’s powerful deck uses high 
turnover to deal lots of effect damage.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:34.250
Since he defeated her quickly…

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.540
He’s super dangerous?

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.910
Exactly.

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:44.580
But judging by his monster, his 
deck doesn't seem offensive.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:48.200
Let me ask one thing before the fight.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.700
What is it?

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:52.410
Scared before the duel begins?

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.410
Everyone is so vain.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:57.740
Why do you fight?

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.590
What a basic question.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:05.440
I fight for Revolver, of course.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.240
Then withdraw.

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:11.390
Do you know what Revolver is trying to do?

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.690
I think I do.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:17.890
If the Tower of Hanoi is finished, the 
worldwide network will be destroyed.

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:22.020
That'll lead to many casualties 
in the real world.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.370
I am aware of that.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:29.840
Even if the world is destroyed, I'll 
always be on Revolver’s side!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.500
You don’t know anything!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.210
About what Revolver and 
the Knights of Hanoi did!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:40.400
It's been continuing since 
the incident ten years ago!

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:46.960
That incident hurt many people 
and ruined their lives!

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:49.790
An outsider shouldn't get involved!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.020
So you think I’m an outsider.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:59.360
But I'm fully involved in the incident.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.360
You’re involved?  What do you mean?

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.920
The Lost Incident ten years ago…

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:08.380
Six children were kidnapped.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:13.180
They were imprisoned in separate rooms.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:19.540
So the six didn’t know 
each others’ faces.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:24.540
Just like I didn’t know 
you, you didn’t know me.

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.900
Hey…

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.520
Can it be?

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:29.980
It can be.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:32.920
I'm one of the six children.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:34.800
What?

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.840
You’re one of the six?

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.320
Seriously?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.780
Then why is he a Knight of Hanoi?

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.900
If you endured the same hell as me-

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:52.460
Hell?  What do you mean?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.520
Am I different?

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.220
Seems so from your point of view.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:03.380
I grew up in an orphanage.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.960
Because I never had relatives.

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:11.720
I lacked the ability to mingle with others.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:17.720
Even among people, I was 
always alone and bored.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:22.360
That’s when that incident occurred.

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:28.320
That incident entertained me.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:32.440
You enjoyed the incident?

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:37.400
Yes.  I enjoyed it.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.760
It was fun.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:44.100
Even if I could go home, loneliness 
and boredom awaited me.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:50.740
I lived like a specter, a ghost.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:54.680
No one talked to me.  No one cared about me.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.720
But it was different there.

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:00.200
Someone was testing me.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.200
Someone expected big things for me.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:09.180
When I realized that, I felt the 
will to live for the first time.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.220
It was like a dream.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:16.880
Unfortunately, that fun time came to an end.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:21.460
Most people feel hurt, right?

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.060
You probably can’t understand.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:32.080
Because if the incident hurt you, you 
must've led a happy life before the incident.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:37.720
After the incident, I was 
returned to the orphanage.

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:41.310
I was forbidden to talk about my experience.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:45.620
Adults treated me cautiously, 
keeping me at arm’s length.

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:48.920
I was more alone than before.

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:55.940
I escaped from the orphanage and 
went to the restricted area.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:59.360
It was locked after the incident.

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:02.300
I kept waiting there.

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.140
Waited?

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:07.620
Thinking about that time…

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:12.900
Hoping those fun times would come back.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:16.240
And that hope came true.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:32.140
When I saw him, I knew instantly 
that he came for me.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:33.860
Revolver…

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.440
So Revolver's been around since back then.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:40.840
You don’t hate the Knights of Hanoi?

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:44.980
Hate?  Revolver gave me a place to belong.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:46.340
So why would I?

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:52.300
Am I weird?

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:59.660
But I think you're weirder, loudly 
proclaiming your sense of justice.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.860
Due to that incident, time 
has stopped moving for me.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:08.300
But due to that incident, time 
has started moving for me.

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.640
This is bad.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.320
He’s dangerous.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.300
Playmaker’s conviction is wavering.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:17.540
Playmaker!  It’s pointless to talk to him!

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.120
You and him are totally different!  Look!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.820
If you waste more time, the Tower 
of Hanoi will be completed!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.680
Playmaker!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.560
I know!  Let’s go!

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:32.820
Sure.  Please try to defeat me.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.260
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:41.260
I discard a Level 2-or-lower monster 
to Special Summon Bitrooper!

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.520
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:54.820
The summoning condition is 
one Level 4-or-lower Cyberse!

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.800
I set Bitrooper!

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:02.700
Appear, Link 1 Link Disciple!

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:07.980
I Special Summon Link Infra-Flier!

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:14.340
I can Special Summon it next 
to my Link Monster's link!

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:19.980
Appear again!  The circuit 
that leads to the future!

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:24.300
The summoning condition is 
one Level 4-or-lower Cyberse!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:26.980
I set Link Infra-Flier!

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:28.940
Link Summon!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:32.510
Appear, Link 1 Link Devotee!

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:42.570
I activate Link Disciple’s effect by 
tributing a monster next to its link!

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:45.280
I draw a card from my deck!

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.570
And return a card in my hand 
to the bottom of my deck!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:51.910
I activate Link Devotee’s effect!

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:58.480
By tributing this card, I Special 
Summon two Link Tokens on my field!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:03.000
Next, I summon Cyberse Gadget!

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:07.000
Cyberse Gadget’s effect activates!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.970
When it’s summoned, I can Special 
Summon Latency from my graveyard...

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:13.710
...in defense position 
by negating its effects.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:20.510
That’s the monster you 
discarded just a while ago.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:24.600
I don't know his deck, so I’ll play solid.

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:27.340
Here comes three consecutive Link Summons!

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:29.570
The circuit that leads to the future!

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:34.260
The summoning conditions 
are two non-Token monsters!

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:37.280
I set Latency and Cyberse Gadget!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.640
Link Summon!

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:43.820
Appear, Link 2 Binary Sorceress!

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:52.600
Cyberse Gadget’s effect activates!

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:58.100
When it's sent from my field to my 
graveyard, I Special Summon a Gadget Token!

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:01.140
I Link Summon again!

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.380
The summoning conditions are two Cyberses!

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:07.020
I set Gadget Token and Link Disciple!

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:13.900
Appear, Link 2 Multi Sledgehammer!

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:16.840
Here's the third!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.360
The summoning conditions 
are two Normal Monsters!

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.340
I set two Link Tokens in the Link Markers!

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:28.420
Appear, Link 2 Binary Blader!

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:33.760
Let's battle!  Go, Binary Sorceress!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:39.720
Too bad, but Dryas can’t be attacked.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:43.800
That attack changes to a direct attack on me.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.720
What?

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:55.140
But Sunavalon Dryas’s effect activates!

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:59.020
Once during each of our 
turns, when I take damage...

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:03.440
...Sunvine Gardna is Special Summoned 
next to Sunavalon’s link!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:07.740
And I regain LP equal to the damage I took!

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:15.480
He regained LP equal to the damage.

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:22.070
I was abandoned at the base of this tree.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.020
When I was a baby.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:33.100
I still remember the view 
I saw from this tree.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:38.260
This tree was in the mountain 
behind the orphanage.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:49.200
After I was abandoned, it took 
days until they found me.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:56.520
During that time, the tree protected me 
from the rain, wind and wild animals.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:08.860
For several years, I was 
raised in the orphanage.

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:14.580
But I only felt peace 
when I was by this tree.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:19.580
When times were tough, this tree healed me.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.040
And then the incident occurred.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:25.820
I had fun during the incident.

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:29.760
My only concern was that I 
couldn’t come to this tree.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.440
But after the incident…

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:38.220
When I returned to the 
orphanage, the tree was gone.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:42.120
Adults had their dumb reasons.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:50.620
That's when my attachment to 
society completely vanished.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:54.380
The only place for me 
is by Revolver’s side.

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:59.920
I give my soul to Revolver!

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:15.670
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:22.810
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:30.040
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:37.390
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:44.630
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:48.780
There were fragments of power

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:55.960
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.190 --> 00:23:03.300
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:10.480
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:17.710
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:24.590
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:32.260
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:41.180
This is a personal fight he must win.

00:23:41.180 --> 00:23:48.500
He vowed not to get others involved, 
but reality wouldn't allow that.

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:53.960
Only his sense of justice prevents 
his spirit from breaking.

00:23:53.960 --> 00:23:59.120
How can the victims of the 
incident feel anything but hate?

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:03.040
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Worthless Justice

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:05.040
Into the VRAINS!
